    {
      "id": "3a3ccf89-f548-4a27-83de-c84250bdffce",
      "name": "Read me",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 1000,
        "height": 175,
        "content": "## EchoLink: one connected workflow\nFifteen-minute standby tick checks independent job intervals configured in the dashboard. Source comments run before ingestion and AI to avoid waiting behind slow inference. Due calendar posts take priority; Page windows, daily caps, spacing, approval and Meta cooldowns apply. No automatic HTTP retry on publishing nodes. Includes RSS fallback, deduplication, approvals, AI generation, photo/text publishing, durable delayed source comments, Airtable logs and engagement analytics.\nEach HTTP stage calls the local EchoLink worker. Manual runs force every stage; scheduled runs execute only due jobs. A failed stage logs via Airtable and stops the run. Start/stop from the dashboard Workflow tab; older schedules must remain stopped. Keep dry run enabled until real model quality and Facebook credentials are verified."
      }
    },
